

-> Definition
   Observer defines one-to-many dependency where observers get notified automatically.

->  Real-Life Example
   YouTube subscribers
   Stock price alerts
   Notification system

-> Advantages
   ✔ Loose coupling
   ✔ Automatic notification
   ✔ Easy scalability

-> Disadvantages
   ❌ Unexpected updates
   ❌ Memory leaks if not unsubscribed